<title>UK: Cazenove Indian GDR Index up 1.4 pct.</title>
<headline>Cazenove Indian GDR Index up 1.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Cazenove Indian GDR Index rose 1.1 points, 1.4 percent to 76.51 points after the Bombay Stock Exchange 30 Share Index rose 71.89 points to 3,419.26</p>
<p>The premium for GDRs over the local market was 9.80 percent.</p>
<p>The Cazenove Index is a capitalisation weighted index calculated from midday to midday.</p>
<p>-- David Chance, London Newsroom +44 171 542 5887</p>
</text>
